# tests/lanes/selftest/.envrc — direnv hook for the 'selftest' lane.
#
# Present so every lane directory has the same three files; there is
# nothing to develop interactively in this lane. What it gives you is the
# fixture's own environment — blank service URLs included — which is
# useful for exactly one thing: reading what the spec expects the
# boundary to produce.
#
# Load order: ../base.env (via source_up) -> ./env.
source_up
dotenv env
